description: Node.js and Fastify conventions for apps/api
globs: apps/api/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# Backend (`apps/api`)

- Fastify ESM (`type: module`). Register plugins and feature modules the way `server.ts` already does.
- New HTTP features go in `src/modules/<feature>/`. Shared adapters go in `src/plugins/` or `src/lib/`.
- Do not reach into `apps/web`. Persist through `@dev-intelligence/database`, not a second Prisma client.
- Validate request input. Keep secrets in env. Do not log access tokens.
- Do not add Fastify plugins, queues, or extra databases without approval.
- Do not split current modules into domain/application/infra folders unless the user approved that layer change.
